#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Signal Refinery Phase 1 — Base runner adapter (2026-10-17).

Catches runners on BASE and feeds the ONE destination: the existing degen
lane, as cards. The user gambles their OWN real money on these cards, so
Base carries a HIGHER bar than Solana (fraud base rate, 1-holder mass,
cheap wash — the per-chain roles from nova-design.md).

What this is NOT:
- No paper entries, no paper lanes, no positions on Base. The bot trades
  nothing from this feed; every buy stays manual.
- Not a launch sniper: it hunts MIDDLES, not births — coins already
  running with a current volume surge, with a continuation check
  confirming the run has room left (inverted whale-exit markers).
  Pool age is not a filter on the trending source (it ranks by surge,
  not recency); the $20M mcap cap + buyer/volume filters keep blue
  chips and dust out. Base discovery latency of ~120s is fine for
  that target (locked scope, 00-READ-FIRST-SCOPE.md).

Six stages (per-chain retune of the nova-design.md funnel):
  1. DISCOVERY: GeckoTerminal base/trending_pools (pages 1-2) PLUS the
     Aerodrome Slipstream dex pool list (pages 1-2) — new_pools proved
     dust-dominated (73 pools, 0 passes, 2026-10-18) and missed
     Aerodrome entirely (~half of Base DEX volume). Rate-safe:
     4 req / 120 s poll.
  2. SURVIVAL PRE-FILTER: cheap fields only (age, liq, mcap, txns).
  3. SAFETY VETOES: GoPlus token_security + Honeypot.is sell simulation,
     via daemon/launch_scanner/safety.py. Fail-CLOSED on unknown
     (user: "I don't want rug coin").
  4. MANIPULATION FILTERS: escape from 1-holder mass (distinct-buyer
     proxy), sell_presence (zero-sell = manufactured; >40% sell share =
     distribution), wash-guard (buys/buyers ratio).
  5. POSITIVE-EVIDENCE GATE: >=1 of volume acceleration / rising buy
     share / organic buyer depth.
  6. CONTINUATION CHECK + SCORE/TIER: inverted exit markers; only tier
     "runner-pick" (score >= 60) reaches the lane.

Guardrails:
- Respects the per-chain feed kill switch (signal_bus.feed_enabled):
  a paused Base feed sends no cards and publishes nothing.
- Own daily card budget: MAX_CARDS_PER_DAY = 1. Solana's feed is
  untouched (its own counter, its own budget).
- Every fired signal is published to the normalized signal bus with
  chain="base", source="base-runner" — cards carry chain + source
  provenance and the tap journal attributes the user's manual buys.

Free-only: stdlib HTTP, free public APIs (GeckoTerminal, GoPlus,
Honeypot.is, DexScreener). No keys, no paid tiers.
"""
